-- =============================================================================
--  0066_bar_shishi_proxy_costs  (DATA, not schema)
--
--  Unit costs for Bar Shishi (counting venue v13) in kount_venue_cost_overrides,
--  so the audit report values Shishi counts at Florida prices, not LA catalog.
--
--  WHY
--  Bar Shishi has no invoices in KevaOS (its R365 location is not read, and
--  per Aditya 2026-10-07 that stays as-is). The closest real prices are
--  Delilah Miami's: same state, same distributors (SGWS FL, Breakthru FL),
--  invoices arriving daily via Craftable.
--
--  WHAT  (247 rows, one per priced Shishi item; source text on every row)
--    · Delilah Miami newest invoice line, per-unit by the 0061 rule
--      (line / pack vs line, whichever is within 2.5x of the catalog cost),
--      with hand corrections where the rule misread a case/bottle
--      (Disaronno, Komos XA, PJ Belle Epoque Rose, ...).
--    · else the catalog cost; else another venue's invoice, else none.
--    · Lines marked "(low confidence ...)" are produce/grocery where the
--      counting unit is not known.
--  is_manual = false and price_date = 2026-08-01 (before Shishi opened), so
--  ANY real Shishi invoice — if one is ever routed — replaces these proxies
--  via kount_refresh_venue_invoice_costs. The proxy's own date is in source.
--
--  REVERSIBLE: delete from kount_venue_cost_overrides where venue_id = 'v13'
--              and set_by = 'shishi-proxy-costing-2026-10-07';
-- =============================================================================
